{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not close the timeline for suspended executions**\n\nON_CHANGE emits PENDING and RETRYING invocations as `RUNNING`, but this unconditionally adds `endTime` and completed duration. Consumers can interpret an active workflow as ended. Pass an end time only when `isTerminal`, and test that suspended records omit both timeline fields.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7s0ayo","finding_digest":"9d41940da5f7ab624cd6a9018d2ba35a89194805d1b7819b0890cec7e537feb8","finding_id":"arf_v1_tvazidnf66vwetgwveay2k5dlk","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationend::nonterminal-end-time-omission","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationend::nonterminal-end-time-omission","line":192,"observation_digest":"7b794763760d7f51a560b8601f2550ec359ea926125a88b8cae022a2beaae600","observation_id":"aro_v1_pn4uoy3wbv7vdjlaxbqb6jkq5q","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_tvazidnf66vwetgwveay2k5dlk","published_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_scztmzrchxwvclkurodp4sbyjj","reviewed_base_sha":"479f023a672bf03f84703cde341df7b48c8eb72a","reviewed_head_sha":"7f3bdc4e67fc71884846370ed3fa3b98f5eb4842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":192,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_hxqczo4vp4n7j7xkb5fxfnxuwv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
